          "content": {
            "size": 10574,
            "mimeType": "text/css; charset=utf-8",
            "compression": 7037,
            "text": "/* Favourites, Share a day and the TV slideshow (site/extras/extras.js), in the On this day look: maroon, gold\n   Garamond, ivory. Website only (bapas-diary.com). Every class starts with bd- so it never clashes with a page. */\n:root {\n  --bd-maroon-in: #42101c; --bd-maroon-out: #160509; --bd-maroon: #6e1424; --bd-ink: #3b1219; --bd-muted: #7a5c4c;\n  --bd-gold-hi: #ffe296; --bd-gold: #ce9840; --bd-gold-soft: #d9a441; --bd-gold-deep: #a8742a; --bd-cap: #faf1de;\n  --bd-paper: #fbf6ec; --bd-ivory: #fbf5e8; --bd-line: rgba(110, 20, 36, .2); --bd-heart: #c81e2a;\n  --bd-serif: \"EB Garamond\", \"Diary Garamond\", Garamond, \"Times New Roman\", serif; --bd-sans: Arimo, \"Diary Arimo\", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n}\n.bd-heart svg, .bd-pill svg, .bd-share svg, .bd-favlink svg, .bd-play svg, .bd-i svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 2; flex: none; }\n.bd-heart[aria-pressed=\"true\"] svg { fill: currentColor; }\n[data-fav]:focus-visible, .bd-share:focus-visible, .bd-pill:focus-visible, .bd-sheet button:focus-visible, .bd-sheet a:focus-visible, .bd-show button:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--bd-gold-hi); outline-offset: 2px; }\n\n/* the round heart in a photo's corner */\n.pic { position: relative; }\n.bd-heart:not(.bd-pill) { position: absolute; top: 8px; right: 8px; z-index: 2; width: 36px; height: 36px; padding: 0; border-radius: 50%; border: 0; cursor: pointer;\n  display: grid; place-items: center; background: rgba(22, 5, 9, .55); color: #fff; backdrop-filter: blur(3px); transition: transform .15s ease, background .2s; }\n.bd-heart:not(.bd-pill)[aria-pressed=\"true\"] { background: var(--bd-cap); color: var(--bd-heart); }\n.bd-heart:active { transform: scale(.88); }\n@media (hover: hover) { article.card .bd-heart:not([aria-pressed=\"true\"]) { opacity: 0; } article.card:hover .bd-heart, article.card:focus-within .bd-heart { opacity: 1; } }\n\n/* pills: Favourite / Share the day in the big view, and in the Today page's photo view */\n.bd-acts { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; padding-top: 10px; }\n.bd-pill { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font: 700 11px var(--bd-sans); letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 999px;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(217, 164, 65, .45); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .28); color: var(--bd-gold-hi); cursor: pointer; }\n.bd-pill.bd-heart[aria-pressed=\"true\"] { background: var(--bd-cap); color: var(--bd-heart); border-color: var(--bd-cap); }\n\n/* Search: share on each date heading, My favourites in the header, Play these */\n.bd-share { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; order: 5; margin-top: 4px; font: 700 10px var(--bd-sans); letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--bd-gold-deep); background: none; border: 1px solid var(--bd-line); border-radius: 999px; padding: 6px 12px; cursor: pointer; }\n.bd-share svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; }\n.bd-share:hover { color: var(--bd-maroon); border-color: var(--bd-maroon); }\n.bd-favlink { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 14px; font: 700 11px var(--bd-sans); letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--bd-gold-hi); text-decoration: none;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(217, 164, 65, .5); border-radius: 999px; padding: 8px 16px; }\n.bd-favlink:hover { background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .25); }\n.bd-play { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin: 4px auto 0; font: italic 600 17px var(--bd-serif); color: var(--bd-maroon); background: none; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bd-gold-soft); padding: 4px 2px; cursor: pointer; }\n.bd-play svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; fill: currentColor; stroke: none; }\n\n/* the share choices */\n.bd-sheet { border: 1px solid var(--bd-line); border-radius: 16px; padding: 18px; width: min(92vw, 420px); background: var(--bd-paper); color: var(--bd-ink); box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, .4); }\n.bd-sheet::backdrop { background: rgba(14, 3, 6, .7); }\n.bd-sheet[open] { display: grid; gap: 10px; }\n.bd-sheet .bd-h { font: 700 12px var(--bd-sans); letter-spacing: .24em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--bd-gold-deep); text-align: center; }\n.bd-sheet .bd-prev { display: block; width: 46%; margin: 2px auto 4px; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(59, 18, 25, .3); }\n.bd-sheet button:not(.bd-x), .bd-sheet a { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 40px 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 12px; text-align: left; padding: 11px 12px; border-radius: 12px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--bd-line); background: #fff; cursor: pointer; font: 600 18px/1.25 var(--bd-serif); color: var(--bd-ink); text-decoration: none; }\n.bd-sheet small { display: block; font: 13px/1.35 var(--bd-sans); color: var(--bd-muted); }\n.bd-sheet .bd-i { width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--bd-maroon); color: var(--bd-gold-hi); display: grid; place-items: center; }\n.bd-sheet .bd-x { justify-self: center; font: italic 600 17px var(--bd-serif); color: var(--bd-muted); background: none; border: 0; cursor: pointer; padding: 6px 12px; }\n\n/* message at the bottom */\n.bd-toast { position: fixed; left: 50%; bottom: calc(18px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px)); z-index: 1000; transform: translate(-50%, 20px); opacity: 0; pointer-events: none;\n  transition: opacity .25s, transform .25s; background: #1d070c; color: var(--bd-cap); border: 1px solid rgba(217, 164, 65, .4); border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 18px;\n  font: 500 17px var(--bd-serif); box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, .4); max-width: calc(100vw - 32px); text-align: center; }\n.bd-toast.on { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, 0); pointer-events: auto; }\n.bd-toast a { color: var(--bd-gold-hi); margin-left: 6px; }\n\n/* text size: the Aa at the end of the menu, and its choices */\n.bd-aa { flex: none; align-self: center; margin-left: 4px; display: inline-flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 1px; border: 1px solid #d9a441; color: #ffe296; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .25);\n  border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 10px; font: 700 12px/1.2 var(--bd-serif); letter-spacing: 0; cursor: pointer; }\n.bd-aa b { font-size: 17px; }\n.bd-aa:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #ffe296; outline-offset: 2px; }\n.ph-top .bd-aa { width: 40px; height: 40px; margin: 0 8px 0 0; padding: 0 0 2px; justify-content: center; align-items: center; border-color: rgba(217, 164, 65, .45); background: rgba(18, 4, 8, .45); font-size: 13px; }\n.ph-top .bd-aa b { font-size: 18px; }\n/* bigger text makes the page bigger, but the menus stay their normal size so they always fit the screen */\nnav.site-menu, .ph-top { zoom: calc(1 / var(--bd-zoom, 1)); }\n.bd-size .bd-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n.bd-size .bd-row button { display: grid !important; grid-template-columns: none !important; justify-items: center; gap: 2px !important; min-width: 96px; padding: 10px 12px !important;\n  font: 600 15px var(--bd-sans) !important; }\n.bd-size .bd-row b { font-family: var(--bd-serif); line-height: 1; color: var(--bd-maroon); }\n.bd-size .bd-row button[aria-pressed=\"true\"] { border: 2px solid var(--bd-maroon) !important; background: #fff7e8 !important; }\n\n/* the slideshow (it always fills the screen at its own size, whatever the text size) */\n.bd-show { zoom: calc(1 / var(--bd-zoom, 1)); }\n.bd-showing, .bd-showing body { overflow: hidden; }\n.bd-show { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 2000; container-type: size; color: var(--bd-cap); cursor: none; outline: 0;\n  background: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 90% at 50% 40%, #2a0a12, #0d0306); }\n.bd-show.awake, .bd-show.paused { cursor: default; }\n.bd-slide { position: absolute; inset: 0 34% 0 0; display: grid; place-items: center; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 1.6s ease; }\n.bd-slide.on { opacity: 1; }\n.bd-frame { background: var(--bd-ivory); padding: 1.2cqh 1.2cqh 3.6cqh; box-shadow: 0 2cqh 6cqh rgba(0, 0, 0, .7); }\n.bd-in { overflow: hidden; }\n.bd-in img { display: block; max-height: 80cqh; max-width: 60cqw; }\n.bd-slide.on img { animation: bd-drift 9s ease-out both; }\n@keyframes bd-drift { from { transform: scale(1.06); } to { transform: scale(1); } }\n.bd-soon { font: italic 500 4cqh var(--bd-serif); color: var(--bd-gold-soft); }\n.bd-words { position: absolute; right: 4%; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); width: 28%; display: grid; gap: .45em; font-size: 2.6cqh; }\n.bd-words .bd-k { font: 700 .62em var(--bd-sans); letter-spacing: .3em; color: var(--bd-gold-soft); text-transform: uppercase; }\n.bd-words .bd-d { font: 700 2.1em/1.05 var(--bd-serif); color: var(--bd-gold-hi); text-wrap: balance; }\n.bd-words .bd-p { font: 600 1.25em var(--bd-serif); }\n.bd-words .bd-c { font: italic 500 1.05em/1.35 var(--bd-serif); color: rgba(250, 241, 222, .7); text-wrap: pretty; }\n.bd-badge { position: absolute; top: calc(3.5% + env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px)); left: 3%; font: 700 1.4cqh var(--bd-sans); letter-spacing: .3em; color: var(--bd-gold-soft); text-transform: uppercase; }\n.bd-bar { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\n  padding: 14px max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-right, 0px)) calc(14px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px)) max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-left, 0px));\n  background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(13, 3, 6, .78)); opacity: 0; transition: opacity .5s; }\n.bd-show.awake .bd-bar, .bd-show.paused .bd-bar { opacity: 1; }\n.bd-bar button { font: 700 11px var(--bd-sans); letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--bd-gold-hi); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .4); border: 1px solid rgba(217, 164, 65, .35); border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 14px; cursor: pointer; }\n.bd-grow { flex: 1 1 80px; height: 3px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .15); border-radius: 2px; overflow: hidden; }\n.bd-grow i { display: block; height: 100%; width: 0; background: var(--bd-gold-soft); }\n.bd-n { font: 700 11px var(--bd-sans); color: rgba(250, 241, 222, .66); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n/* a phone held upright: the photo on top, the words under it */\n@container (max-aspect-ratio: 1 / 1) {\n  .bd-slide { inset: 0 0 32% 0; }\n  .bd-in img { max-height: 58cqh; max-width: 90cqw; }\n  .bd-words { left: 6%; right: 6%; top: auto; bottom: 12%; width: auto; transform: none; text-align: center; font-size: 2cqh; }\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .bd-slide { transition: none; } .bd-slide.on img { animation: none; } .bd-toast { transition: none; } }\n\n/* Easier to read on a phone: the smallest words a little bigger (website review, 28 Oct 2026) */\n.bd-share span, .bd-favlink span { font-size: 12px }\n"
