            "compression": 2013,
            "text": "/* The website's two lettering choices, the same on every page (Darpan, 28 Oct 2026: \"Lora can be your heading font,\n   Poppins for subtitle things, leave the other bits as they are\"). Our own copies in /fonts/ (no Google link).\n   Added last in every page's <head> by tools/web_type.py, so it wins over each page's own fonts; only the font\n   changes here, never sizes, colours or places. Body text, captions and story lines keep their own fonts. */\n@font-face { font-family: \"Diary Lora\"; font-weight: 500; font-display: swap; src: url(/fonts/lora-latin-500-normal.woff2) format(\"woff2\"); }\n@font-face { font-family: \"Diary Lora\"; font-weight: 600; font-display: swap; src: url(/fonts/lora-latin-600-normal.woff2) format(\"woff2\"); }\n@font-face { font-family: \"Diary Lora\"; font-weight: 700; font-display: swap; src: url(/fonts/lora-latin-700-normal.woff2) format(\"woff2\"); }\n@font-face { font-family: \"Diary Poppins\"; font-weight: 400; font-display: swap; src: url(/fonts/poppins-latin-400-normal.woff2) format(\"woff2\"); }\n@font-face { font-family: \"Diary Poppins\"; font-weight: 500; font-display: swap; src: url(/fonts/poppins-latin-500-normal.woff2) format(\"woff2\"); }\n@font-face { font-family: \"Diary Poppins\"; font-weight: 600; font-display: swap; src: url(/fonts/poppins-latin-600-normal.woff2) format(\"woff2\"); }\n:root { --lora: \"Diary Lora\", \"Diary Garamond\", \"EB Garamond\", Georgia, serif;   /* Gujarati letters come from the families after */\n  --poppins: \"Diary Poppins\", \"Diary Arimo\", Arimo, Arial, sans-serif; }\n\n/* ---------- headings: Lora ---------- */\nh1, h2, h3,\n#title, #all-title, #picker-title, .yhead h3, #cards .yr,                               /* Today, favourites */\n#t1, .mlab, .bnum, .ph-mt b,                                                              /* Calendar */\nbutton.when,                                                                              /* Search */\n.who, #year, div#place, .ho-line, #tape b, .nm,                                         /* Travels, Places */\n.iy, h2.date,                                                                             /* Through the years */\n#crumb, span#place, .moment, .guru, #gap b,                                              /* Then and now */\np.jay, #weekly-signup-h                                                                   /* About */\n{ font-family: var(--lora) !important; }\n\n/* ---------- subtitles, labels, menu and buttons: Poppins ---------- */\nnav.site-menu a, .gu-switch .e,                                                           /* the menu on every page */\n.sub, #subtitle, .pill, .caps, .yhead a, .tripnote, .pl, .fest, .rm-open, #remind button, #controls label, #all-count, .ph-hint-one,\n.wkd, #years button.yr, .ymark, .fmark, #jrow small, #play, #zl, .ph-years button, .ph-mt span, .ph-grid .wk, .ph-ymark, .ph-fmark, .ph-ftag,\n#sub, .flabel, .badge, .mandir, #cards .place, #big-prev, #big-next, #c-try button, #c-ask button,\n.yrs, .status, .ho-date, a.tn, #lead,\n.ia, .age, a.more, .btn, .step .w,\n.tagline, span.date, #gapbox small, button.next,\nfigcaption, p.rubric, .page h2, .weekly-signup button,\n.kicker, a.main, a.soft\n{ font-family: var(--poppins) !important; }\n/* Poppins is a little wider than Arimo: on phones the bottom tabs are a touch smaller and lighter so every word fits */\n@media (max-width: 760px) {\n  nav.site-menu a { letter-spacing: 0 !important; font-weight: 500; }\n  nav.site-menu a:not([href=\"/through-the-years/\"]):not([href=\"/then-and-now/\"]), nav.site-menu a::after { font-size: 10px !important; }\n}\n@media (min-width: 761px) and (max-width: 1199px) { nav.site-menu a { letter-spacing: .1em; } }\n"
