          "content": {
            "size": 2383,
            "mimeType": "text/css; charset=utf-8",
            "compression": 1006,
            "text": "/* The Screensaver button on the Today page, the \"entering screensaver state\" box over the page gone soft, and the\n   full screen frame (Darpan, 29 Oct 2026). Website only. Colours and fonts are the Today page's own. */\n.ss-launch { display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: clamp(14px, 2vw, 26px) 0 0; }\n.ss-big {\n  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 16px 34px; border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer;\n  font: 700 14px/1 var(--sans); letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--maroon-out); background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f3cf7a, var(--gold-soft)); border: 1px solid #f3cf7a;\n  box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, .35), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, .45);\n  transition: transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease;\n}\n.ss-big:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, .4), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, .45); }\n.ss-big svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; fill: currentColor; flex: none; }\n@media (max-width: 600px) { .ss-big { padding: 15px 26px; font-size: 13px; } }\n\n/* the page goes soft behind the question */\n.ss-asking .page, .ss-asking .site-menu { filter: blur(10px) brightness(.55); transition: filter .5s ease; }\n.ss-asking body { overflow: hidden; }\n.ss-ask { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 2147483000; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 24px; background: rgba(22, 5, 9, .35); animation: ss-in .35s ease; }\n@keyframes ss-in { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }\n.ss-box {\n  max-width: 460px; width: 100%; padding: 30px 30px 26px; border-radius: 16px; text-align: center;\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #3d0d18, #22060c); border: 1px solid rgba(217, 164, 65, .55); color: var(--cream);\n  box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, .6);\n}\n.ss-box h2 { margin: 0 0 12px; font: 400 clamp(22px, 3vw, 28px)/1.2 var(--serif); color: var(--gold-hi); }\n.ss-box p { margin: 0 0 8px; font: 400 16px/1.5 var(--serif); }\n.ss-box .ss-small { font: 400 13px/1.4 var(--sans); color: #e8c98a; letter-spacing: .02em; }\n.ss-row { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; margin-top: 20px; }\n.ss-row .pill { padding: 13px 26px; font-size: 12px; }\n\n/* the screensaver fills the window */\n.ss-frame { position: fixed; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0; margin: 0; z-index: 2147483001; background: #120408; }\n.ss-open, .ss-open body { overflow: hidden; }\n"
          },
